        <activityName xml:lang="en">Polystyrene foam slab, 45% recycled, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Polystyrene foam slab, 45% recycled, at plant
Combination of material and processing module. EPS foam slab has a density of 28 kg/m3 and a thermal conductivity of 0.036 W/mK;
Synonyms: EPS; 
UUID: 28b97167-0833-3624-8acb-b3f71c007911
Includes grinding and thermoforming processes
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Swiss average EPS production; process from 1 factory in Switzerland
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_28b97167-0833-3624-8acb-b3f71c007911.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
